@battousai  You can blame it on the missed weight, sure, but I don't see how there's an argument that Alex Perez didn't absolutely run through InnerG (and I picked InnerG). Charles landed a decent jab and head kick and that was about it. Then Perez beat him around the cage and got a first round TKO over a guy who had never been finished before.

I'm still split on Johnson vs. Su, and it's definitely fair to speculate that Perez went for a calculated weight miss and otherwise would not have been able to TKO Charles, but it was an almost 100% one-sided beating, and that has to be taken into account in a matchup against another lanky striker with nearly identical physical attributes to Charles... all of this without mentioning the decent performance that Perez put on against Almabayev on his return from the knee injury.
